      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners OBrien Swaine are delighted to present to the market this c. 0.5 acre site in Ballintim, Camolin SUBJECT TO PLANNING PERMISSION. This site currently has planning for a 2 bed dwelling and domestic garage. Planning reference: 20251712W. Local needs will apply. (WITH IN 15 kMS AND 7 YEARS PRINCIPLE PRIVATE RESIDENCE) \n\nOutline in red is for indicative purposes only.\n\nThe site is ideally located just c. 3km from Camolin Village, where a range of local amenities can be found including a primary school, playground, GAA grounds, takeaway, pub, petrol station, Cois Na hAbhainn Cafe & Garden Centre, and more. The bustling town of Gorey is approximately 12km away and offers an extensive range of amenities including supermarkets, secondary schools, shops, restaurants and excellent public transport links. The N11 motorway is also within easy reach, making commuting highly convenient."
